## About the standard

Open standard for verifiable application security requirements.

The control and requirement statements below are reproduced in English from the publisher’s open data.

Official source: [OWASP ASVS 5.0.0](https://github.com/OWASP/ASVS/releases/tag/v5.0.0_release).

